# The fist: a jab, twice in a row; the third use within the combo's window is a finisher. Each is a
# line 2.8 m along the look that holds what it hits for a moment (its hit said with who it was: the
# brawl mod's damage).

motion Jab on use if not linked and brawl.combo < 2
	until brawl.fist.used or pressed.jump
	cooldown 0.3
	lasts 0.05
	change brawl.combo += 1
	change brawl.combo_left = 1
	cast ray range 2.8
		emit brawl.jab.hit
		impulse 4 along move

motion Finisher on use if brawl.combo >= 2
	cooldown 0.3
	lasts 0.05
	change brawl.combo = 0
	cast ray range 2.8
		emit brawl.finisher.hit
		impulse 14 along move
		impulse 5 along up
